1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Willett married Martha CHICK in Goudhurst , Kent , 19 November 1778.  Martha was born in Goudhurst , Kent before 10 December 1758.  Martha was the daughter of John CHICK and Elizabeth.  Martha died before 0
2 CONC 7 March 1844 in Goudhurst , Kent , at approximately 85 years of age.  Her body was interred 07 March 1844 in Goudhurst , Kent .  She was christened in Goudhurst , Kent , 10 December 1758.  She resided in Etchingham, East Susex 184
2 CONC 1, Hurst Green.  At the time of the 1841 census, Martha was lodging with William Mepham.
