2 CONT
2 CONT Will of Daniel Easley from Alabama archives:
2 CONT
2 CONT I Daniel W. Easley of Greene Co, and state of Alabama concerning the uncertainty of this mortal life and being weak in body but of sound and perfect mind and memory do make and fashion this my last will and testament in manner and
2 CONC  form following that is to say I five and bequeath my estate both real and personal of what nature or kind so even I may be to my son Roderick Easley and my daughter Sarah Cade, Polly Harper, ELIZABETH FINCH, wife of John Finch, M
2 CONC artha Bird, Susan Parker and Pricilla Cate to be equally divided among them after paying all my just debts I having heretofore given to my sons Warham and Edward Easley their portion of my estate I do herby constitute and appoint 
2 CONC Richard B. Wathall of Perry County and State aforesaid sole executor of this my last will and testament revoking hereby all former wills or testaments by me heretofore made in whereof I have herewith let my hand and official my se
2 CONC al to the sixth day of December 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT DW Easley 
2 CONT
2 CONT Test 
2 CONT
2 CONT Geo C. King 
2 CONT
2 CONT Clemman Phillips 
2 CONT
2 CONT WJ House
2 CONT
