2 CONC r and Mrs Sears and family, Mr and Mrs Bowler and family and infant born on board and Maria Shareliffe (servant), Mr and Mrs Abbott, Mr R. Snow, Mr John Dalley, Mrs Ruddle, three Misses Ruddle, Mr G. Ruddle, Mr C. Cripps, Mr John 
