1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BLACKNEY . — On the 23rd April, at her mother's residence, Barnett-street, Kensington, May, the beloved daughter of Mary Jane Blackney, and loving sister of Mary, Sarah, Lucy, Ethel, James, Alfred, George and Harry
2 CONC , late of Chiltern, aged 28 years. Ever remembered.
2 CONT
2 CONT Victoria Death Record - May COHEN; Age: 27; Year: 1919; Place: Kenston; Father: Cohen Richd; Mother: Mary Jane; Mother's LNAB: BATEMAN.
