1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Excerpt frpm Two May Families Benjamin F. May married Emma Alston They had no children "We always called B. F. May - "Dock" - he got to be a Doctor; Practiced medicine in Marengo Co., Ala. There is where he met and married Miss Em
2 CONC ma Alston. She was very pretty. I went to see them after the War was over. ----------- Changed original birth date. Error report yielded: Emma Augusta ALSTON 31 Dec 1800 The age at death is greater than 120. On p.210 of Two May Fa
2 CONC milies shows her to be 10 years younger than her husband.
