2 CONT
2 CONT West, Michael Adrian - May 29 1996 at hospital, late of Minto lived husband of Lynette loved father of Joseph, Daniel, Katrina and Adam loved son of Esma and Andrew (deceased) loved brother and brother-in-law of Ray and Tricia, Ly
2 CONC nn and Stephen, Wendy and David and Les and Kay and their families. Aged 39 years. At peace.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael's relatives and friends are kindly invited to attend his funeral service to be held at Forest Lawn Memorial Gardens Crematorium Camden Valley Way Leppington on Monday (june 3 1996) commencing at 11.30am. Please assemble at
2 CONC  the chapel.
