2 CONT
2 CONT Doctor "Dock" Tolley, the son of Daniel & Rebecca Whitehead Tolley, was a farmer. 
2 CONT He was born around 10 Mar 1872 in Carter County, Tennessee.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Jane McKinney 12 May 1903 in Carter County, Tennessee.  
2 CONT Together, they had 7 children:  
2 CONT John, 
2 CONT James, 
2 CONT Nancy, 
2 CONT Mary, 
2 CONT Manda, 
2 CONT Eula, & 
2 CONT Clarence.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at age 72 on 7 Mar 1945 in Carter County, Tennessee.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/98463560/doctor-tolley Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 23 2023
